{"strongs": "H0539", "word": "אָמַן", "translit": "a.man", "root": "אמן", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb confirm, support", "gloss": "support", "definition": "I. [ אָמַן ] verb confirm, support (compare Arabic , etc., see below; Sabean אמן in derivatives & proper names compare CIS iv.1,10 DHM ZMG 1885,598 ; Aramaic אֲמַן , in Haph`el, Ethiopic , Assyrian in derivatives) — only Qal Participle אֹמֵן — 1. as verb support , nourish 2Kgs 10:1 ; 2Kgs 10:5 ; Esth 2:7 , 2. as substantive foster-father Num 11:12 ( J ) Isa 49:23 . 3. אֹמֶנֶת foster-mother, nurse Ruth 4:16 ; 2Sam 4:4 . 4. אֹמְנוֺת pillars, supporters of the door 2Kgs 18:16 . Participle passive a. הָאֱמֻנִים those brought up (in scarlet) Lam 4:5 . \\ \\ b. אֱמוּנִים intransitive faithful (as firm, stable) as substantive masculine faithful ones Ps 12:2 (> ᵐ5 ᵑ6 and others faithfulness ) 2Sam 20:19 (compare Arabic be faithful , trust in , be secure ); Ps 31:24 faithful ones ׳ י Keepeth , ׳ אֱמוּנִים נֹצֵר י ; but ׳ א is here taken by ᵐ5 Ri De Che as abstract noun see אֵמֻן . Niph`al נֶאֱמַן Prov 11:13 + (6 t); Imperfect יֵאָמֵן , יֵאָ֫מֶן 1Kgs 8:26 + (9 t.); Participle נֶאֱמָן Prov 25:13 + ( 16 t.) נֶאֱמָנָה Isa 1:21 + ( 4 t.); נֶאֱמֶנֶת Ps 89:29 נֶאֱמָנִים Prov 27:6 + (9 t.); נֶאֱמָנוֺת Deut 28:59 . 1. carried by a nurse Isa 60:4 . 2. made firm, sure, lasting: place Isa 22:23 ; Isa 22:25 name 1Chr 17:24 waters Isa 33:16 ; Jer 15:18 an event Hos 5:9 sickness mercy Isa 55:3 . 3. confirmed, established , sure: kingdom 2Sam 7:16 house, dynasty 1Sam 2:35 ; 1Sam 25:28 ; 1Kgs 11:38 ; 1Chr 17:23 prophet Samuel 1Sam 3:20 compare word-play אִם לֹא תַאֲמִינוּ לֹא תֵאָמֵנוּ = if ye believe not (have not firm confidence) ye will not be confirmed Isa 7:9 וְתֵאָמֵנוּ ׳ הַאֲמִינוּ בי = believe in Yahweh and ye will be confirmed 2Chr 20:20 . 4. verified , confirmed: words of God 1Kgs 8:26 ; 2Chr 1:9 ; 2Chr 6:17 his precepts Ps 111:7 testimonies Ps 19:8 ; Ps 93:5 covenant Ps 89:29 words of men Gen 42:20 ( E ). 5. reliable, faithful, trusty: persons 1Sam 2:35 ; 1Sam 22:14 ; Job 12:20 ; Ps 89:38 ; Ps 101:6 ; Prov 25:13 ; Isa 8:2 ; Neh 13:13 a city Isa 1:21 האל הנאמן the faithful God Deut 7:9 compare Isa 49:7 נֶאֱמַן רוּחַ faithful in spirit (disposition) Prov 11:13 לְבָבוֺ נֶאֱמָן his heart faith-ful Neh 9:8 עֵד אֱמֶת וְנֶאֱמָן true and faithful witness Jer 42:5 נאמנים פצעי אוהב faithful the wounds of a loving one Prov 27:6 with נֵת Ps 78:8 עִם Hos 12:1 בְּ of thing Ps 78:37 בְּכָלבֵּֿיתִי in all my house (of Moses) Num 12:7 ( E ). Hiph`il הֶאֱמִין Gen 45:26 + (18 t.); Imperfect יַאֲמִין , יַאֲמֵן Job 15:31 + (30 t.); Imperative הַאֲמִינוּ 2Chr 20:20 + (2 t.); Participle מַאֲמִין Deut 1:32 ; Josh 25:16 . 1. stand firm Job 39:24 (with negative of the horse when the trumpet sounds Di De MV RVm ; but neither believeth RV , hardly trusts Da ). 2. trust, believe: \\ \\ \\ ( a ) absolute Exod 4:31 ( J ) Isa 7:9 ; Isa 28:16 ; Hab 1:5 ; Ps 116:10 ; Job 29:24 \\ \\ \\ ( b ) with ל of person, trust to, believe Gen 45:26 ( E ) Exod 4:1 ; Exod 4:8 ( J ) Jer 40:14 ; 2Chr 32:15 with God Deut 9:23 ; Isa 43:10 ל of thing Exod 4:8 ; Exod 4:9 ( J ) Ps 106:24 ; 1Kgs 10:7 ; 2Chr 9:6 ; Isa 53:1 ; Prov 14:15 \\ \\ \\ ( c ) with ב of person, trust in, believe in Exod 19:9 ( J ) 1Sam 27:12 ; 2Chr 20:20 ; Job 4:18 ; Job 15:15 ; Prov 26:25 ; Jer 12:6 ; Mic 7:5 the usual construction with God Gen 15:6 ( E ) Exod 14:31 ; Num 14:11 ( J ) Num 20:12 ( P ) Deut 1:32 ; 2Kgs 17:14 ; 2Chr 20:20 ; Ps 78:22 ; Jonah 3:5 with ב of thing Deut 28:66 ; Job 15:31 ; Job 24:22 ; Job 39:12 ; Ps 78:32 ; Ps 106:12 ; Ps 119:66 \\ \\ \\ ( d ) with כִּי trust or believe that Exod 4:5 ( J ) Job 9:16 ; Lam 4:12 \\ \\ \\ ( e ) so with infin. Job 15:22 ; Ps 27:13 also trust to do a thing, almost = allow , Judg 11:20 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB527')\">BDB527</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H539')\">H539</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H547')\">H547</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB526')\">BDB526</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB528')\">BDB528</entry></div><p> I. [<bdbheb>אָמַן</bdbheb>] <b>verb confirm, support</b> (compare Arabic <placeholder275/>, etc., see below; Sabean <bdbheb>אמן</bdbheb> in derivatives &amp; proper names compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('CIS')\">CIS<sup>iv.1,10</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('DHM')\">DHM<sup>ZMG 1885,598</sup></lookup>; Aramaic <bdbarc>אֲמַן</bdbarc>, <placeholder276/> in Haph`el, Ethiopic <placeholder277/>, Assyrian in derivatives) — only <b>Qal</b> Participle <bdbheb>אֹמֵן</bdbheb> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> as verb <highlight>support</highlight>, <highlight>nourish</highlight> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 10:1\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(12,10,1)\">2Kgs 10:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 10:5\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(12,10,5)\">2Kgs 10:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 2:7\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(17,2,7)\">Esth 2:7</ref>, </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> as substantive <highlight>foster-father</highlight> <ref ref=\"Num 11:12\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(4,11,12)\">Num 11:12</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Isa 49:23\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(23,49,23)\">Isa 49:23</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <bdbheb>אֹמֶנֶת</bdbheb> <highlight>foster-mother, nurse</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ruth 4:16\" b=\"8\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(8,4,16)\">Ruth 4:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 4:4\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(10,4,4)\">2Sam 4:4</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <bdbheb>אֹמְנוֺת</bdbheb> <highlight>pillars, supporters of the door</highlight> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 18:16\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(12,18,16)\">2Kgs 18:16</ref>. Participle <highlight>passive</highlight> a. <bdbheb>הָאֱמֻנִים</bdbheb> <highlight>those brought up</highlight> (in scarlet) <ref ref=\"Lam 4:5\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(25,4,5)\">Lam 4:5</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <bdbheb>אֱמוּנִים</bdbheb> intransitive <highlight>faithful</highlight> (as firm, stable) as substantive masculine <highlight>faithful ones</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ps 12:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,12,2)\">Ps 12:2</ref> (&gt; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Syr')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ6</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> and others <highlight>faithfulness</highlight>) <ref ref=\"2Sam 20:19\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(10,20,19)\">2Sam 20:19</ref> (compare Arabic <placeholder278/> <highlight>be faithful</highlight>, <placeholder279/> <highlight>trust in</highlight>, <placeholder280/> <highlight>be secure</highlight>); <ref ref=\"Ps 31:24\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(19,31,24)\">Ps 31:24</ref> <highlight>faithful ones</highlight> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <highlight>Keepeth</highlight>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אֱמוּנִים נֹצֵר י</bdbheb>; but <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> is here taken by <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ri')\">Ri</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('De')\">De</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Che')\">Che</lookup> as abstract noun see  <bdbheb><reflink>אֵמֻן</reflink></bdbheb>. Niph`al <bdbheb>נֶאֱמַן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 11:13\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(20,11,13)\">Prov 11:13</ref> + (6 t); Imperfect <bdbheb>יֵאָמֵן</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>יֵאָ֫מֶן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:26\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,26)\">1Kgs 8:26</ref> + (9 t.); Participle <bdbheb>נֶאֱמָן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 25:13\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(20,25,13)\">Prov 25:13</ref> + ( 16 t.) <bdbheb>נֶאֱמָנָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 1:21\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(23,1,21)\">Isa 1:21</ref> + ( 4 t.); <bdbheb>נֶאֱמֶנֶת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 89:29\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,29)\">Ps 89:29</ref> <bdbheb>נֶאֱמָנִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 27:6\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(20,27,6)\">Prov 27:6</ref> + (9 t.); <bdbheb>נֶאֱמָנוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 28:59\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"59\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"59\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,59)\">Deut 28:59</ref>. 1. <highlight>carried</highlight> <highlight>by</highlight> <highlight>a nurse</highlight> <ref ref=\"Isa 60:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"60\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"60\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,60,4)\">Isa 60:4</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>made</highlight> <highlight>firm, sure, lasting:</highlight> place <ref ref=\"Isa 22:23\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(23,22,23)\">Isa 22:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 22:25\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(23,22,25)\">Isa 22:25</ref> name <ref ref=\"1Chr 17:24\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(13,17,24)\">1Chr 17:24</ref> waters <ref ref=\"Isa 33:16\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(23,33,16)\">Isa 33:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 15:18\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(24,15,18)\">Jer 15:18</ref> an event <ref ref=\"Hos 5:9\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(28,5,9)\">Hos 5:9</ref> sickness <wrongReferenceRemoved/> mercy <ref ref=\"Isa 55:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"55\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"55\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,55,3)\">Isa 55:3</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>confirmed, established</highlight>, <highlight>sure:</highlight> kingdom <ref ref=\"2Sam 7:16\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(10,7,16)\">2Sam 7:16</ref> house, dynasty <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:35\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,35)\">1Sam 2:35</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 25:28\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(9,25,28)\">1Sam 25:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 11:38\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(11,11,38)\">1Kgs 11:38</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 17:23\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(13,17,23)\">1Chr 17:23</ref> prophet Samuel <ref ref=\"1Sam 3:20\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(9,3,20)\">1Sam 3:20</ref> compare word-play <bdbheb>אִם לֹא תַאֲמִינוּ לֹא תֵאָמֵנוּ</bdbheb> = <highlight>if ye believe not</highlight> (have not firm confidence) <highlight>ye will not be confirmed</highlight> <ref ref=\"Isa 7:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,7,9)\">Isa 7:9</ref> <bdbheb>וְתֵאָמֵנוּ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַאֲמִינוּ בי</bdbheb> = <highlight>believe in Yahweh and ye will be confirmed</highlight> <ref ref=\"2Chr 20:20\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(14,20,20)\">2Chr 20:20</ref>. 4. <highlight>verified</highlight>, <highlight>confirmed:</highlight> words of God <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:26\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,26)\">1Kgs 8:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 1:9\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(14,1,9)\">2Chr 1:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 6:17\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(14,6,17)\">2Chr 6:17</ref> his precepts <ref ref=\"Ps 111:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"111\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"111\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,111,7)\">Ps 111:7</ref> testimonies <ref ref=\"Ps 19:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,19,8)\">Ps 19:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 93:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"93\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"93\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,93,5)\">Ps 93:5</ref> covenant <ref ref=\"Ps 89:29\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,29)\">Ps 89:29</ref> words of men <ref ref=\"Gen 42:20\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(1,42,20)\">Gen 42:20</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>). 5. <highlight>reliable, faithful, trusty:</highlight> persons <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:35\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,35)\">1Sam 2:35</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 22:14\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(9,22,14)\">1Sam 22:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 12:20\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(18,12,20)\">Job 12:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 89:38\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,38)\">Ps 89:38</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 101:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"101\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"101\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,101,6)\">Ps 101:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 25:13\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(20,25,13)\">Prov 25:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 8:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,8,2)\">Isa 8:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 13:13\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(16,13,13)\">Neh 13:13</ref> a city <ref ref=\"Isa 1:21\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(23,1,21)\">Isa 1:21</ref> <bdbheb>האל הנאמן</bdbheb> <highlight>the faithful</highlight> <highlight>God</highlight> <ref ref=\"Deut 7:9\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(5,7,9)\">Deut 7:9</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Isa 49:7\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(23,49,7)\">Isa 49:7</ref> <bdbheb>נֶאֱמַן רוּחַ</bdbheb> <highlight>faithful in spirit</highlight> (disposition) <ref ref=\"Prov 11:13\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(20,11,13)\">Prov 11:13</ref> <bdbheb>לְבָבוֺ נֶאֱמָן</bdbheb> <highlight>his heart faith-ful</highlight> <ref ref=\"Neh 9:8\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(16,9,8)\">Neh 9:8</ref> <bdbheb>עֵד אֱמֶת וְנֶאֱמָן</bdbheb> <highlight>true and faithful witness</highlight> <ref ref=\"Jer 42:5\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(24,42,5)\">Jer 42:5</ref> <bdbheb>נאמנים פצעי אוהב</bdbheb> <highlight>faithful the wounds of a loving one</highlight> <ref ref=\"Prov 27:6\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(20,27,6)\">Prov 27:6</ref> with <bdbheb>נֵת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 78:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"78\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"78\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,78,8)\">Ps 78:8</ref> <bdbheb>עִם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 12:1\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(28,12,1)\">Hos 12:1</ref> <bdbheb>בְּ</bdbheb> of thing <ref ref=\"Ps 78:37\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"78\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"78\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(19,78,37)\">Ps 78:37</ref> <bdbheb>בְּכָלבֵּֿיתִי</bdbheb> <highlight>in all my house</highlight> (of Moses) <ref ref=\"Num 12:7\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(4,12,7)\">Num 12:7</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>). Hiph`il <bdbheb>הֶאֱמִין</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 45:26\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(1,45,26)\">Gen 45:26</ref> + (18 t.); Imperfect <bdbheb>יַאֲמִין</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>יַאֲמֵן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 15:31\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(18,15,31)\">Job 15:31</ref> + (30 t.); Imperative <bdbheb>הַאֲמִינוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 20:20\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(14,20,20)\">2Chr 20:20</ref> + (2 t.); Participle <bdbheb>מַאֲמִין</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 1:32\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(5,1,32)\">Deut 1:32</ref>; <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Josh 25:16\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(6,25,16)\">Josh 25:16</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>stand</highlight> <highlight>firm</highlight> <ref ref=\"Job 39:24\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(18,39,24)\">Job 39:24</ref> (with negative of the horse when the trumpet sounds <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('De')\">De</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MV')\">MV</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('RV')\"><reflink>RVm</reflink></lookup>; but <highlight>neither believeth</highlight> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('RV')\"><reflink>RV</reflink></lookup>, <highlight>hardly trusts</highlight> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Da')\">Da</lookup>). 2. <highlight>trust, believe:</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;\\&emsp;(<highlight>a</highlight>) absolute <ref ref=\"Exod 4:31\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(2,4,31)\">Exod 4:31</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Isa 7:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,7,9)\">Isa 7:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 28:16\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(23,28,16)\">Isa 28:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hab 1:5\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"5\" onc